AppNeta Intelligent Alarm ({S 304}) - {S 306} on item {S 308}

SYMPTOMS:

An AppNeta Intelligent Alarms DnsLookupError rule was triggered, indicating a DNS lookup
failure for the monitored target.

PROBABLE CAUSES:

An unresolvable hostname, an unreachable name server, or a stale/incorrect DNS record for
the monitored target, as determined by AppNeta's own monitoring criteria for this rule.

RECOMMENDED ACTIONS:

Review this alarm's details in AppNeta's Intelligent Alarms console to determine root cause.
This alarm clears automatically when AppNeta reports the underlying condition resolved.
